      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00564",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我站起身来，冷不防地把老寡妇撞倒了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I stood up and, without warning, knocked the old widow down.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00564",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "实是令人不可思议。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was truly unbelievable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00564",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "老寡妇似乎无暇思及惊愕了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The old widow seemed to have no time even to feel astonished.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00564",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "被撞倒以后，她依然平静地闭上双目在继续念经。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even after being knocked down, she calmly kept her eyes closed and continued chanting sutras.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
